>> the changes are all otherwise "behind the scenes' for the express purpose 
>> of the SHELL support later.  Every attempt will be made to retrofit the 
>> SHELL into the next release if at all possible, but this could fail, 
>> necessitating yet another revision, but it is projected the need for such a 
>> release is slim to none, but it isn't easy to predict two steps in advance 
>> at the same time, etc.
>>
